{"title": "Weapon Master", "pageid": 4947, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Weapon_Master", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Weapon_Master.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Weapon_Master.webp/300px-Weapon_Master.webp, /w/images/0/0b/Weapon_Master.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Weapon_Master.webp/300px-Weapon_Master.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Weapon_Master.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Weapon Master</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. Users of this feature are Proficient with additional types of weapons.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Increase your <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n</p><p>Gain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> with four <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon\">Weapon</a> types of your choice. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Master_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Master (Feat)\">Weapon Master (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201513\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplicati